    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at FitzGerald’s are delighted to bring this spacious and well-maintained four-bedroom family home known as No. 8 Parkview to the market. Located just off the sought-after Freshford Road in the northern side of Kilkenny City. The property is within 400ms of St. Lukes General Hospital and is within walking distance of a range of amenities including shops, churches, St. Canice's Co-Ed National School, CBC Secondary School and recreational facilities including Dicksboro GAA Club. \r\n\r\nNo. 8 Parkview is a two-storey semi-detached house built in the 1950’s with an integrated garage to the right. The property benefits from a walled entrance with a private tarmac driveway, providing ample off-street parking and a welcoming first impression. A rear extension has enhanced the home, incorporating a practical utility room and a stylish modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property offers bright and comfortable accommodation consisting of a generous sized entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, dining room, utility room and a modern family bathroom. The first floor comprises of 4 generous sized bedrooms, toilet room and bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the large and vibrant front and rear gardens provides an ideal space for families, gardening enthusiasts, or those who enjoy outdoor entertaining. The property has a large garden shed/boiler house to the rear. A notable feature of this home is its dual access, adding convenience and flexibility for everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe property presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families, or those seeking a home with further potential. No. 8 Parkview may be eligible for the Croí Cónaithe Vacant Homes Grant and the SEAI warmer homes grant, offering additional appeal for prospective purchasers.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all this property has to offer. \r\n\r\nServices\tMains water, mains drainage, telecoms, gas central heating, double glazed uPVC windows."
      },
      {
